{"seq":1,"slug":"son-of-a-physician","title":"Son Of A Physician","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/son-of-a-physician","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"birth-in-stagira","title":"出生于斯塔吉拉","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/son-of-a-physician/birth-in-stagira","wordCount":1729,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"early-life","title":"早年生活","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/life-and-times/son-of-a-physician/early-life","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<p>本章追溯亚里士多德的出身与早年。他出生于希腊北部的小城斯塔吉拉，父亲是马其顿王室的宫廷御医——这一医师家庭的背景，培养了他对经验观察、对具体自然事物的浓厚兴趣。年幼失怙的亚里士多德，怀着强烈的求知渴望，于十七岁奔赴雅典求学。本章呈现&quot;医师之子&quot;亚里士多德的早年生命及其思想品格的根源。</p>\n"}